<h1>Radio waves in a mini street</h1><p><b>Click anywhere</b> to move the phone mast. See if its waves reach the satellite dish, and whether buildings protect it.</p>
<canvas id="c"></canvas><div class="k"><span style="background:#ffbe00;margin-left:0"></span>Mast<span style="background:#1ec85a"></span>Satellite dish<span style="background:#2a2e3d"></span>Buildings<span style="background:#d6604d"></span><span style="background:#4393c3;margin-left:2px"></span>Wave peaks and troughs</div>
