## START_HERE: 9 rows, 8 cols
Valmet × Since AI 2026 — Synthetic Industrial Metaverse Builder Data Pack
Purpose | Builder-ready synthetic environment for the Industrial Metaverse demonstrator.
Scale | 30 assets · 20,160 raw telemetry records · 1,000 events · 300 historical work orders · 38 RAG docs.
Core journey | 3D object → asset identity → current condition → evidence → documentation → explainable AI → safe verification / maintenance workflow.
Real Valmet scene | Not received yet. Scene_Anchors is deliberately a replaceable mapping layer; only scene paths/coordinates need remapping when the splat arrives.
Interoperability | Designed for web, Unreal, Unity, OpenUSD/Omniverse or other suitable 3D stacks.
Trustworthy AI | Explicit source IDs, confidence, data quality and mapping confidence let teams distinguish evidence from hypotheses.
Safety/IP | Everything is synthetic; no real customer geometry/process data, confidential thresholds or autonomous field-control instructions.
Raw ML file | telemetry_full_14d_30min.csv contains the full telemetry corpus; Excel includes a recent 3-day sample for easy inspection.

